er some semisolid capsule lots failed dissolution; affected lots were detected before release.","status":"reported_primary","verified_by_package":false,"witness_ref":"sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846"},{"key":"form_ii_solubility_and_stability","kind":"measurement","scope":"condition-specific Abbott measurements, not a universal ratio","source_refs":["sha256:619891679328480497a678084d26bfbea88fecebaa75badeb4914a14cae05700"],"statement":"Under the reported formulation and measurement conditions, Form II was more stable and substantially less soluble than Form I; at 5 °C in 85:15 ethanol/water the reported solubilities were 61 and 294 mg/mL respectively.","status":"measured_primary","verified_by_package":false,"witness_ref":"sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"},{"key":"later_anhydrous_form_iii","kind":"measurement","scope":"source-scoped nomenclature comparison","source_refs":["sha256:2df11686634a2cea35f82d5d907ced7c99060eeb13674508a37ead9f84918ca1","sha256:e7cf48345cf6d766945d81fc9ff9bf0ed9bd82bbbf14076b40cc4f8a380dfa9e"],"statement":"Later work used Form III for an anhydrous polymorph, distinct from the 2003 paper's Form III formamide solvate.","status":"measured_primary","verified_by_package":false,"witness_ref":"sha256:3cebad801d897888b0730c98dfb3f3792d4326909d76b5a356f400a228a212ff"},{"key":"origin_and_personnel_transfer_unresolved","kind":"reported_history","scope":"historical causation remains unresolved","source_refs":["sha256:052e253ac4ca05655f485897dac7d34fd74040cc37cffbb52cbde8ba0d378c5b"],"statement":"The timing of Form II at the Italy site after a personnel visit and the original nucleation source were reported as debatable or unknown, not proven global airborne transmission.","status":"reported_primary","verified_by_package":false,"witness_ref":"sha256:1f034c52815185dce8ba4a25c9e7dc6bb1faeb78c54feb2b37fc111a5f79c045"},{"key":"solvent_changes_selectivity","kind":"measurement","scope":"2024 laboratory solvent-screening conditions","source_refs":["sha256:06849edb748723598e6b51d19a779d70694c2c7da8e0447db8cb2ffa52eca654"],"statement":"Later experiments reported that solvent selection and supersaturation influence ritonavir crystallizability and polymorphic selectivity.","status":"measured_primary","verified_by_package":false,"witness_ref":"sha256:e22cdc8ca1c0d0654a55e831a1ae9b9b87e233ec30589dc35f3668bc356546bd"}]},"reason":"reference_artifact_with_source_bounded_scientific_claims","training_eligible":false}
